{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "serviautos-backend-collection",
		"name": "ServiAutos Backend API",
		"description": "Colección completa de APIs para el sistema ServiAutos Backend - Gestión de talleres automotrices\n\n## Variables de Entorno\n- `base_url`: URL base del API (Producción: https://serviautos-backend-production.up.railway.app)\n- `token`: Token JWT para autenticación (se captura automáticamente al hacer login)\n\n## Endpoints de Métricas\n- `/actuator/prometheus`: Métricas en formato Prometheus (formateadas automáticamente)\n- `/actuator/health`: Estado de salud de la aplicación\n- `/actuator/metrics`: Lista de métricas disponibles",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "📊 Métricas y Monitoreo",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Obtener Métricas Prometheus",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/actuator/prometheus",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["actuator", "prometheus"]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene las métricas de la aplicación en formato Prometheus. La respuesta se formatea automáticamente para mejor visualización.\n\n**Incluye métricas de:**\n- Peticiones HTTP (total, duración por endpoint)\n- Métricas de JVM (memoria, GC, CPU)\n- Métricas del sistema\n\n**Ver resultado formateado en la consola de Postman (View > Show Postman Console)**"
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const rawText = pm.response.text();",
									"    const lines = rawText.split('\\n');",
									"    ",
									"    // Organizar métricas por categoría",
									"    const categories = {",
									"        '📈 HTTP Requests': [],",
									"        '⏱️ HTTP Duration': [],",
									"        '💾 JVM Memory': [],",
									"        '🗑️ JVM GC': [],",
									"        '🖥️ System': [],",
									"        '📋 Other': []",
									"    };",
									"    ",
									"    let currentCategory = '📋 Other';",
									"    let currentMetric = '';",
									"    ",
									"    lines.forEach(line => {",
									"        if (line.startsWith('# HELP')) {",
									"            const match = line.match(/^# HELP (\\w+)/);",
									"            if (match) {",
									"                currentMetric = match[1];",
									"                ",
									"                if (currentMetric.includes('http_request') && currentMetric.includes('total')) {",
									"                    currentCategory = '📈 HTTP Requests';",
									"                } else if (currentMetric.includes('http_request') && currentMetric.includes('duration')) {",
									"                    currentCategory = '⏱️ HTTP Duration';",
									"                } else if (currentMetric.includes('jvm_memory')) {",
									"                    currentCategory = '💾 JVM Memory';",
									"                } else if (currentMetric.includes('jvm_gc')) {",
									"                    currentCategory = '🗑️ JVM GC';",
									"                } else if (currentMetric.includes('process_cpu') || currentMetric.includes('system')) {",
									"                    currentCategory = '🖥️ System';",
									"                } else {",
									"                    currentCategory = '📋 Other';",
									"                }",
									"            }",
									"        }",
									"        ",
									"        if (line.trim() !== '') {",
									"            categories[currentCategory].push(line);",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    // Construir respuesta formateada",
									"    let formattedOutput = '\\n' + '='.repeat(80) + '\\n';",
									"    formattedOutput += '📊 MÉTRICAS PROMETHEUS - ORGANIZADAS\\n';",
									"    formattedOutput += '='.repeat(80) + '\\n\\n';",
									"    ",
									"    Object.keys(categories).forEach(category => {",
									"        if (categories[category].length > 0) {",
									"            formattedOutput += `\\n${category}\\n`;",
									"            formattedOutput += '-'.repeat(80) + '\\n';",
									"            ",
									"            // Agrupar por métrica",
									"            let currentMetricGroup = '';",
									"            categories[category].forEach(line => {",
									"                if (line.startsWith('# HELP')) {",
									"                    if (currentMetricGroup) formattedOutput += '\\n';",
									"                    const metricName = line.match(/^# HELP (\\w+)/)?.[1] || '';",
									"                    currentMetricGroup = metricName;",
									"                    formattedOutput += `\\n  🔸 ${metricName}\\n`;",
									"                }",
									"                if (!line.startsWith('#')) {",
									"                    // Formatear línea de métrica",
									"                    const parts = line.split(' ');",
									"                    if (parts.length >= 2) {",
									"                        const metricLine = parts[0];",
									"                        const value = parts[parts.length - 1];",
									"                        formattedOutput += `    ${metricLine.padEnd(70)} ${value}\\n`;",
									"                    } else {",
									"                        formattedOutput += `    ${line}\\n`;",
									"                    }",
									"                } else if (line.startsWith('# TYPE')) {",
									"                    formattedOutput += `    ${line}\\n`;",
									"                }",
									"            });",
									"            formattedOutput += '\\n';",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    formattedOutput += '\\n' + '='.repeat(80) + '\\n';",
									"    formattedOutput += `Total de líneas de métricas: ${rawText.split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim() && !l.startsWith('#')).length}\\n`;",
									"    formattedOutput += '='.repeat(80) + '\\n';",
									"    ",
									"    console.log(formattedOutput);",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('Métricas obtenidas correctamente', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
									"        pm.expect(rawText).to.include('http_requests');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
